/-- **Unconditional Specification of `greedySet8135` (`Theorem 3(b)`)**:
`greedySet8135` is an explicit `8,135`-element normal set of odd primes (`5 ≤ p ≤ 321,053`)
satisfying `1 < ∑_{p ∈ G} 1/p` (over `ℚ` and `ℝ`) and `10 ^ 40732 < ∏ p < 10 ^ 40733`. -/
