/-- **Exactness of the Normal-Set Threshold `N₁ = 8,135`**:
Combining `hN1` (`∀ P, … → 8135 ≤ P.card`) with `exists_normal_odd_prime_set_8135`,
`8,135` is the exact minimum cardinality of a normal odd prime set with `∑ 1/p > 1`. -/
